follow the patterns already present in this repo.

---

## summary
state what will be built.

## filediff tree
a treestruct of filediffs. legend: [+] create · [~] update · [-] delete

## codepath tree
a treestruct of codepaths. legend: [+] create · [~] update · [○] retain · [-] delete · [←] reuse · [→] eject

## test coverage
mandatory, equal weight to implementation. coverage by layer (transformers unit; communicators, orchestrators integration; contracts integration + acceptance with snapshots), by case (positive, negative, happy, edge), and a test tree with the same legend.

the ruled fulcrums owe these clamps, each named in the test tree:
- F8: a stale link set, or a shadow skill without its peers, fails loud at boot or re-materialize
- F11: a repo that relied on a .this override boots both roles after a1, per the 3.1 count; the change ships only on the commander release review

## open questions for the commander
the blueprint is the commander review. NEVER best-guess an open blueprint question. list each as:
- the question
- the options, stated fairly
- your lean, and why

